trust: observed · updated 2026-10-01 · links: 3 out / 4 in
## Fix
Yield the connection and close it after the yield. Scan for offenders with the `find-leaked-fixtures` script; procedure in [[debug-hanging-tests]].

═══ debug-hanging-tests · playbook · .claude/skills/debug-hanging-tests/SKILL.md [linked]
links: 2 out / 1 in
# Debugging a hanging test suite

1. Confirm the hang happens after the last test (summary printed).
2. `py-spy dump --pid <pid>`; look for non-daemon threads.
3. Map the thread to a fixture; check [[pytest-fixture-teardown]].
4. Run `strata run find-leaked-fixtures -- --path tests/`.

