═══ postgres-connection-pool · shard/fact · knowledge/database/postgres/postgres-connection-pool.md [linked]
trust: verified · updated 2026-10-01 · verified 2026-10-01 · links: 2 out / 1 in
Every app instance opens a `psycopg_pool.ConnectionPool` with `max_size=20` and a non-daemon maintenance thread.

